  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial support to WUS-SA4s administration and audits during a six months period (Febr-July 1998) Agreement extened in August 1998 to cover an activity period do 30 September 1998. A second extension of the agreement foran activity period to 31 december 1998, with additional fund, was agreed in november 98. WUS-SA is closing down.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till WUS-SA f&#xf6;r administration och utredningar under sex m&#xe5;nader (febr-juli 1998). Avtalet f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngdes i augusti 1998 f&#xf6;r en aktivitetsperiod till 30 september. Ytterligare f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngning av en aktivitetsperiod till 31 december 1998, med tillskott av extra medel, gjordes november 1998. WUS-SA upph&#xf6;r som organisation 31 december 1998</narrative>
